values ('d5e6f7a8-9b0c-4d75-8e26-3f4a5b6c7d85', 'international-global-marketing', 'International/Global Marketing', 'This course prepares students to design, justify, and execute marketing strategy across borders. Students learn how culture, institutions, trade policy, market data, digital platforms, customer behavior, channel systems, pricing, brand architecture, regulation, sustainability, and geopolitical risk shape international marketing decisions. The course culminates in a market-entry or global expansion plan supported by data, customer insight, financial logic, and ethical judgment.');

